WEBVTT

00:01:28.417 --> 00:01:30.284
and an Iranian-American,

00:01:30.308 --> 00:01:34.095
I'm deeply concerned
about what this means for our freedoms

00:01:34.119 --> 00:01:36.290
and what kinds of protections we need.

00:01:36.993 --> 00:01:40.453
I believe we need
a right to cognitive liberty,

00:01:40.477 --> 00:01:43.369
as a human right
that needs to be protected.

00:01:43.772 --> 00:01:46.415
If not, our freedom of thought,

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:49.463
access and control over our own brains

00:01:49.487 --> 00:01:52.328
and our mental privacy will be threatened.

00:01:53.698 --> 00:01:54.856
Consider this:

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:58.194
the average person thinks
thousands of thoughts each day.

00:01:58.697 --> 00:01:59.848
As a thought takes form,

00:01:59.872 --> 00:02:04.928
like a math calculation
or a number, a word,